<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<div class="narrow" style="max-width:640px;">
  <div style="text-align:center; font-size:44px; margin-top:10px;">🔒</div>
  <h1 style="text-align:center;"><%= wasUpdate ? 'Proposal updated' : 'Proposal submitted successfully' %></h1>
  <p class="sub" style="text-align:center;">Your <%= wasUpdate ? 'changes have been saved' : 'proposal has been securely submitted' %>. It stays sealed — competing professionals never see your terms, and the buyer will not see your identity until they choose to connect with you.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="sumrow"><span>Buyer</span><span>Searching in <%= buyer.search_areas %></span></div>
    <div class="sumrow"><span>Price range / timeline</span><span><%= buyer.price_range %> · <%= buyer.timeline %></span></div>
    <div class="sumrow"><span>Window closes</span><span><%= new Date(buyer.closes_at).toLocaleString('en-US', { timeZone: 'America/Denver' }) %> (Mountain) — or when all spots fill</span></div>
    <div class="sumrow"><span>Status</span><span style="color:var(--good);">Sealed until the window closes</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="sealed" style="margin-top:14px;">✏️ <span>Until the proposal window closes, you can review, edit, or withdraw your proposal any time. After it closes, proposals are locked and revealed to the buyer together.</span></div>

  <div class="sealed" style="margin-top:10px; border-left:4px solid var(--muted);">⚖️ <span><b>Important:</b> Submitting a proposal does not create a contract or guarantee that the buyer will hire you. If you are selected to connect, any representation agreement or other contract must be entered into separately between the client and your brokerage.</span></div>

  <div class="actions" style="justify-content:center; margin-top:18px; display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <a class="btn ghost" href="/agent/buyers/<%= buyer.id %>">Edit proposal</a>
    <form method="POST" action="/agent/buyers/<%= buyer.id %>/withdraw" onsubmit="return confirm('Withdraw your proposal for this buyer?');">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
      <button class="btn ghost danger" type="submit">Withdraw proposal</button>
    </form>
    <a class="btn" href="/agent">Return to dashboard</a>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
